{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/4d59ad014c7cc91721ff6d91ef68d24d.avif?t=1756255894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras_big/4d59ad014c7cc91721ff6d91ef68d24d.avif?t=1756255894 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights unfold on a grid-based battlefield filled with unpredictable tile effects. Adapt your strategy, position your units carefully, and guide your team through deadly encounters. The fate of the Widlands depends on your command. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.poster.avif?t=1756255894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.webm?t=1756255894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.mp4?t=1756255894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your warrior band by recruiting heroes from distinct classes, each with their own unique skills and combat roles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes through battle, upgrade their stats, and choose from a wide range of powerful perks to shape your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath. All warriors who fall in battle stay dead every fight carries real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your path through the Widlands in a roguelike structure with branching routes, randomized encounters, and increasing danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across dynamic environments where certain tiles trigger traps, curses, forced movement, or other effects that can shift the tide of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse enemy roster, each with unique equipment, abilities, and perks that challenge your tactical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter different final bosses at the end of each run each presenting a unique threat and requiring a different approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend earned reputation and gold points between runs to unlock stronger warriors and expand your options for future expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game revolves around killing enemies on grid-based battlefields. This results in a mild gore such as blood splatters or blood pools, but gore certainly isn't focus of the game.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523030?t=1756255894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/34a8b445a8099f620f19d65f35b3403be9eab5af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756255894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/7bec3a1fb6447fb26f5d67025409c579d84022d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756255894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/7bec3a1fb6447fb26f5d67025409c579d84022d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756255894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/4d59ad014c7cc91721ff6d91ef68d24d.avif?t=1756255894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras_big/4d59ad014c7cc91721ff6d91ef68d24d.avif?t=1756255894 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fights unfold on a grid-based battlefield filled with unpredictable tile effects. Adapt your strategy, position your units carefully, and guide your team through deadly encounters. The fate of the Widlands depends on your command. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.poster.avif?t=1756255894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.webm?t=1756255894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/extras/d62fe1ef90c5b027fbedf3b9d67d689e.mp4?t=1756255894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your warrior band by recruiting heroes from distinct classes, each with their own unique skills and combat roles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes through battle, upgrade their stats, and choose from a wide range of powerful perks to shape your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath. All warriors who fall in battle stay dead every fight carries real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your path through the Widlands in a roguelike structure with branching routes, randomized encounters, and increasing danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across dynamic environments where certain tiles trigger traps, curses, forced movement, or other effects that can shift the tide of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a diverse enemy roster, each with unique equipment, abilities, and perks that challenge your tactical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter different final bosses at the end of each run each presenting a unique threat and requiring a different approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend earned reputation and gold points between runs to unlock stronger warriors and expand your options for future expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game revolves around killing enemies on grid-based battlefields. This results in a mild gore such as blood splatters or blood pools, but gore certainly isn't focus of the game.</i></p>","developers":["Ludus Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523030/bd82f970d779bd6975aa8b0b1d0687219a2de6b7/header.jpg?t=1756255894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or more recent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 1.7+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Widlands Dominion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista/7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7+ GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Must support OpenGL 2.1 or hig